WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:05.833
What did you do to PJ3?

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:08.625
I customized him a little, that's all.
Ready?

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:16.375
It's a movie.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:19.333
I read about it in a book.

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:20.291
Humans.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.875
What are they doing?

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:23.750
-They're dancing.
-"Dancing"?

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:27.583
Humans dance
when they feel happy or jovial.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.166
She's gone haywire.

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:35.916
I'm dancing.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.750
I want to learn what happy is.

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:44.458
If humans dance when they're happy,
dancing might help me understand.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:50.000
If I understand human emotions,
I can trust Sara's decisions.

00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:06.125
You too, Dad.

00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:08.750
I don't know how.

00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:11.291
-Don't worry about it.
-Whoa!

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.583
Close your eyes

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:40.333
Sleep tight, little baby

